{title: Open the Eyes of My Heart (FJ_3_en)}
{song_number: 3}
{language: en}
{key: E}

{comment: Chorus}
[E]Open the eyes of my heart, Lord.
[B/D#]Open the eyes of my heart.
[A/C#]I want to [A]see You, [Bsus4/E]I want to [E]see You.

{comment: Verse}
[E]To see You [B/D#]high and lifted [C#m]up,
[A]shining in the light of Your [Bsus4]glory.
[B]Pour out Your power and [C#m]love,
as we sing: [F#m7]Holy, holy, [Bsus4]holy.

{comment: Ending}
[E]Holy, holy, holy.
[B/D#]Holy, holy, holy.
[A/C#]Holy, holy, holy.
[A]I want to [Bsus4/E]see You.
